# scripts/jobs/seq2cause-bench-26-10-05-xl-latent-s3-annotate.sh on a CPU host, reading this run's synced reads.
# Sizing: l discover took 3.1–3.7 h of probe wall clock and probe costs are flat in V through xl
# (the xl validation sweeps cost what l's did), so ≈ 3.5–4.5 h; peak device ≤ 8 GiB at N = 16.
# One command per line; the runner's cwd is the harness directory; set -e stops at the first failure.
